## 5. Cross-Repo Impact

Since Thanos and Grafana would use this interface, they would need to:
1. Update their QueryEngine implementations to include the new method
2. Handle the QueryPlan return type in their frontend components
3. Potentially add API endpoints to expose query explanation functionality

The implementation should be backward compatible since it only adds a new method to the interface without changing existing functionality.

